*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]   Common keyword of CB011031 feature
...               Shift SSB to overlap with LTE PBCH
...               Prerequisite : gNB configured with adapted SCF based from 23R1 KDDI SCF + default 24R1 parameters
...               Scope : 11031-A
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : marie-laurence.le_borgne@nokia.com

...               Creation Date               : 01-11-2023
...               Version History  Date           Author                                Notes
...               0.1              02-11-2023     marie-laurence.le_borgne@nokia.com    Creation
...               0.2              25-09-2024     richard.duthu@nokia.com               Produce Scout Data through "Test Teardown" + some RF50 fixes


Library           OperatingSystem
Library           Collections
Library           ArchiveLibrary

Resource          ./resources/robot/CB011031_Tests_Keywords.robot


Suite Setup                 Suite Setup for CB011031
Suite Teardown              Suite Teardown

Test Setup                  CB011031 Test Setup
Test Teardown               CB011031 Test Teardown


*** Variables ***
${TestSharkTool}            MC_SHARK

# basic and iphy settings
&{cell_mod1}                cellnum=1
...                         nr_arfcn=636000
...                         gscn=7867

&{cell_mod2}                cellnum=2
...                         nr_arfcn=636000
...                         gscn=7867

@{allcells_mod}             &{cell_mod1}
...                         &{cell_mod2}

#Test setting
&{params-B3}                nbCell=4
...                         ssbPositionsInBurst=4
...                         ssbPositionsInBurst_NRIRFIM=4
...                         ssbPositionsInBurst_NRIAFIM=4
...                         actPdschAtSsbSlots=true
...                         actPdschRmCsirsForTracking=true
...                         CPRTcapture=True
...                         timeCapture=60s

# ue's settings
&{dict_ue1}                  sa_or_nsa=sa
...                          ueid=1
...                          cell_id=1
...                          trf_id=1
...                          shouldBeStop=True
...                          DL_deviation=10
...                          UL_deviation=35
...                          DL_throughput=570
...                          UL_throughput=30
...                          protocol=udp

&{dict_ue2}                  sa_or_nsa=sa
...                          ueid=21
...                          cell_id=2
...                          trf_id=2
...                          shouldBeStop=True
...                          DL_deviation=10
...                          UL_deviation=35
...                          DL_throughput=570
...                          UL_throughput=30
...                          protocol=udp

@{dict_ue_all}               ${dict_ue1}
...                          ${dict_ue2}

*** Test Cases ***

[1]CB011031_B_3_Interworking_with_5GC002534_5CG002538_PDSCH_at_SSB_and_TRS_slots_SA_call
    TC_CB011031-SA_master    params=${params-B3}            dict_ues=${dict_ue_all}         arfcn_iphy=@{allcells_mod}
    [Teardown]        Setup.Test Teardown

